From ca8584ac6a8b87c4884b7546323d76099f0cad1a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "JQE Chief Engineer (Claude)" <jqe-bot@example.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 05:23:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/37] build: update requirements.txt with the full target
 stack
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds scipy, pydantic, pydantic-settings, loguru, fastapi, uvicorn,
SQLAlchemy, alembic, and pytest-cov — previously missing despite being
part of the documented tech stack. Groups dependencies by concern with
a comment on each group's purpose.

Marks MetaTrader5 with an environment marker (sys_platform == win32)
so 'pip install -r requirements.txt' succeeds on Linux/macOS dev and
CI machines instead of hard-failing on an uninstallable package.
---
 requirements.txt | 39 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 37 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/requirements.txt b/requirements.txt
index 56d332c..59a71ca 100644
--- a/requirements.txt
+++ b/requirements.txt
@@ -1,8 +1,43 @@
-MetaTrader5
+# ==========================================================
+# JQE Trading Platform — Python dependencies
+# ==========================================================
+# Grouped by concern. Keep additions in the right group and
+# add a comment noting why a dependency was introduced.
+
+# --- Trading platform -------------------------------------
+# MetaTrader5 only ships a Windows build. The environment marker below
+# lets `pip install -r requirements.txt` succeed on Linux/macOS dev and
+# CI machines instead of hard-failing; see docs/architecture.md for how
+# the test suite stubs this package on non-Windows platforms.
+MetaTrader5; sys_platform == "win32"
+
+# --- Data & numerical computing ----------------------------
 pandas
 numpy
+scipy
+
+# --- Configuration & validation -----------------------------
+pydantic>=2.0
+pydantic-settings>=2.0
 python-dotenv
+
+# --- Logging --------------------------------------------------
+loguru
+
+# --- Analytics & visualization --------------------------------
 matplotlib
+plotly
+
+# --- API (Milestone: api/) -------------------------------------
+fastapi
+uvicorn[standard]
+
+# --- Persistence (Milestone: portfolio/, journal/) --------------
+SQLAlchemy>=2.0
+alembic
+
+# --- Testing & tooling --------------------------------------------
 pytest
+pytest-cov
 black
-ruff
\ No newline at end of file
+ruff
-- 
